DyoevMail0P8fqLb2Eg\n\nHere's the scene from the original: https://twitter.com/adoringtamanegi/status/1477520131115065344?s=20&t=L-gDyoevMail0P8fqLb2Eg\n\nThere are various types of coloring, as for a long time the only coloring available was the black and white one from the comic book.\nWe will leave it up to you to decide which one you would like to use.\n\nWe would like the scene to be the original scene where she is being rescued and treated, but a normal standing picture would also be fine.\n\nThank you in advance!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 854536, "client_id": 950458, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8468b168/uploads/origins/13d28c94-1162-4861-92a1-1494bcf7fd43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d006008f567e6a5e4af07593b3b1071", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8468b168/uploads/origins/13d28c94-1162-4861-92a1-1494bcf7fd43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d006008f567e6a5e4af07593b3b1071, https://si.imgix.net/8468b168/uploads/origins/13d28c94-1162-4861-92a1-1494bcf7fd43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f361bf35ca8dbf6e434a9bb2cac513e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8468b168/uploads/origins/13d28c94-1162-4861-92a1-1494bcf7fd43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c57b30f4ebcb74e8bba45ae0e42712e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8468b168/uploads/origins/13d28c94-1162-4861-92a1-1494bcf7fd43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d7f51b26d138bc282c3fd663640cc7e3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8468b168/uploads/origins/13d28c94-1162-486