9\u2026\uff01(\u6c17\u5206\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u7740\u66ff\u3048\u3055\u305b\u308b\u611f\u3058\u3067\u3059\u3002)\n\u3057\u305f\u304c\u3044\u307e\u3057\u3066\u65b0\u898f\u3067\u3082\u3001\u904e\u53bb\u4f5c\u54c1\u306e\u5dee\u5206\u4f5c\u6210\u3068\u3044\u3046\u5f62\u3067\u3082\u5168\u7136\u69cb\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\u2026\uff01\n\nURL\u306f\u904e\u53bb\u4f9d\u983c\u3044\u305f\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u4f5c\u54c1\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3068\u3001\u5fcd\u8005\u8863\u88c5\u306e\u5f69\u8036\u3055\u3093\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3068\u3001\u4ed8\u3051\u3066\u9802\u304d\u305f\u3044\u624b\u7532\u3067\u3059(\u8272\u306f\u554f\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\u2026\uff01)\u3002\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/3?s=09\nhttps://onsen-musume.jp/news/97675\n\nhttps://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B001DDSJ7Y/ref=cm_sw_r_apan_glt_i_A7G049MET2JN95C5MZKA", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 854536, "client_id": 1372916, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/16594ef6/uploads/origins/fb0df8de-13bb-43f9-a030-7454c9b0bc3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60635826e969ca3262a1cac423a3a3ec", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/16594ef6/uploads/origins/fb0df8de-13bb-43f9-a030-7454c9b0bc3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60635826e969ca3262a1cac423a3a3ec, https://si.imgix.net/16594ef6/uploads/origins/fb0df8de-13bb-43f9-a030-7454c9b0bc3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88b15d65f96aa38a954051f4932b6075 2x, https://si.imgix.net/16594ef6/uploads/origins/fb0df8de-13bb-43f9-a030-7454c9b0bc3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ebae4308838f5e774ce612ce5e27e82c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/16594ef6/uploads/origins/fb0df8de-13bb-43f9-a030-7454c9b0bc3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bdc4f8e35ceba68e503ad29e5829ab7f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/16594ef6/uploads/origins/fb0df8de-13bb-43f9-a030-7454c9b0bc3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bdc4f8e35ceba68e503ad29e5829ab7f, https://si.imgix.net/16594ef6/uploads/origins/fb0df8de-13bb-43f9-a030-7454c9b0bc3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=917d32a5dc91a2cccac400f6ef6fe946 2x, https://si.imgix.net/16594ef6/uploads/origins/fb0df8de-13bb-43f9-a030-7454c9b0bc3f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7043f3b291eb1b15b93e778410b30169 3x"}, "body": "It's nice to meet you at Skeb.\nThis time, I'd like to ask you to draw an illustration of a two-shot of the onsen musume Dai-boss Sukunahiko-sama and the stray onsen musume, Mashuko-san of Kawayu Onsen.\n(About Mashuko-san: )\nhttps://twitter.com/teshikaga_tv/status/1309250486499860480 )\n\nSukunahiko-sama, who came to Lake Mashu on a private trip, chatted with Mashuko-san, an old acquaintance (or is it a god?). I would like to have a situation where Sukunahiko is enjoying chatting with Mashuko-san, who is an old acquaintance (Chigami?).\n\nI'd like to use the finished product as an icon or header, so please give me permission to use it as well.\n\nSo, I'd be happy if you could draw it when you have time.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Halcyon_utaitai/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 854536, "client_id": 44809, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/55862e99/uploads/origins/8fe13cb8-2e2b-47f5-ae42-5430ee096fe1?bg=%23fff&au